            "command": "claude \"We have a failing test in test_auth.py:\ntest_empty_password_rejected.\nFollow the engineering partner loop:\n  1. confirm which file to edit\n  2. propose a plan before touching any code\n  3. after I approve, make the minimal edit\n  4. run the test suite and report exit code\n  5. show me the diff\nDo not touch any file outside auth/.\"",
            "topic": "CLAUDE",
